          "id": "msg_0d498ec2449fdb88016ab8f8974c7087d1868e49ab77587cbb",
          "text": "The main source of confusion is that the experiments changed both the regions and the rules. Better balance sometimes came from allowing much more overlap; other comparisons used different numbers of regions.",
